(Garden Shed Submains - Installation Guide) Tj
T*
(This guide covers wiring a garden shed from a house switchboard.) Tj
T*
(The maximum cable run from the house switchboard to the shed is 40 metres.) Tj
T*
(Use 6 mm2 SDI cable for the submains.) Tj
T*
(The shed circuit must be protected by a 32 A RCBO at the house switchboard.) Tj
ET
endstream
