(Commissioning and Testing) Tj
T*
(Before energising the shed circuit, measure the earth loop impedance.) Tj
T*
(The earth loop impedance must be below 1.5 ohms.) Tj
T*
(Record all results in the schedule of test results.) Tj
T*
(A certificate of compliance must be issued when the work is complete.) Tj
ET
